{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otherness</strong> is a psychological horror game about isolation, frustration and the slow erosion of the self. <br>You play as someone trapped between memory and decay, searching for meaning in a world that no longer feels real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore quiet, decaying environments where something always feels a little off. The story unfolds through the spaces you move through and the objects you find, slowly revealing what keeps you from moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134820/extras/201afac7d64713c98932ba29bec64024.poster.avif?t=1767720835\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134820/extras/201afac7d64713c98932ba29bec64024.webm?t=1767720835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134820/extras/201afac7d64713c98932ba29bec64024.mp4?t=1767720835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror rooted in emotion</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeply unsettling environments</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melee combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory and environmental puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low-poly PS1-style visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline pos